      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Koro is a unique psychiatric disorder in which acute anxiety accompanies the perception of genital retraction. This case report describes a case of Koro syndrome associated with penile and scrotal pain. A review of the literature has not shown any previous report of Koro associated with genital pain."},
